 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">『Evilos』は、太古の邪悪な魔術師となり、正義漢たちの果てなき波状攻撃を迎え撃つアクション・タワーディフェンスです。進化する魔法の武器と呪文の膨大なアーセナルで王国を破壊し、10のアクトを通じて精鋭の眷属たちで防御を固めよう。今回は、あなたがラスボスだ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">隕石、竜巻、稲妻など、破壊の呪文ですべての英雄を殲滅せよ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">魔力を宿した銃器のアーセナルを解き放ち、敵を凍らせ、焼き、感電させ、消し去れ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/65ea861e9d557a7e3527661a4642355d.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/65ea861e9d557a7e3527661a4642355d.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/65ea861e9d557a7e3527661a4642355d.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">死者を蘇らせ、あなた専属の護衛とせよ。ジャック・マロウ、ニコラス・リブケイジ、スケアリー・ポッター、ヴィンセント・ヴァン・ゴア、アーノルド・シュワルツェネクロが命令を待っている！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/960b46e4a663d4712639c32744e81ff4.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/960b46e4a663d4712639c32744e81ff4.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/960b46e4a663d4712639c32744e81ff4.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">武器と呪文を強化・進化させ、より凶悪な新たな姿へと変えよう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a89866f65623025cfa617206138244d1.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a89866f65623025cfa617206138244d1.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a89866f65623025cfa617206138244d1.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">王国全土にわたる10のアクトで世界に復讐せよ。各アクトは手強いボス戦で幕を閉じる。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >主な特徴</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>悪役を演じよ</strong> — 太古の邪悪な魔術師となり、千年の眠りから目覚め、奪われた力を取り戻せ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>呪われしアーセナル</strong> — 無数の武器と呪文の組み合わせを見つけ、美しくも邪悪なシナジーを生み出して敵を殲滅せよ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>強化と進化</strong> — 各武器と呪文を強化・進化させ、より凶悪な最終形態へ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>死者を蘇らせよ</strong> — 倒れた勇者たちを専属の眷属として従えよ</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>制覇すべき王国</strong> — 100のステージが10のアクトに分かれ、それぞれが壮大なボス戦で幕を閉じる</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>王国はお前を封印し、それをハッピーエンドと呼んだ。それを書き換える時だ——Evilos をウィッシュリストに追加し、ラスボスになれ。</i></strong></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">『Evilos』は、太古の邪悪な魔術師となり、正義漢たちの果てなき波状攻撃を迎え撃つアクション・タワーディフェンスです。進化する魔法の武器と呪文の膨大なアーセナルで王国を破壊し、10のアクトを通じて精鋭の眷属たちで防御を固めよう。今回は、あなたがラスボスだ！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/52b4d0718f5b833a717820a084b9731a.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">隕石、竜巻、稲妻など、破壊の呪文ですべての英雄を殲滅せよ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/a1ed5180136defedffa0d315f930b22e.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">魔力を宿した銃器のアーセナルを解き放ち、敵を凍らせ、焼き、感電させ、消し去れ。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap